        "_comment": "Single $self auto loop: invocation-scoped job names make consecutive iterations safe (the old invoke-iteration/need-more-iteration alternation workaround is gone). A contract-progress updateData landing mid-loop evaluates these autos but its continuation is dropped while the loop's own hop jobs are live.",
